        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Acorn RI4BQ, Heart Tip Cabinet Strap Rough Iron Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 6-1/2\" Rough Iron Strap Hinge is suitable for light weight doors or cabinets. Its old world charm is in both the heart tip design and in the rough iron finish which duplicates the texture of naturally weathered iron. The Rough Iron Cabinet Heart Tip Strap Hinge has a lifetime no rust warranty. <a href=\"/collections/acorn-heart-tip-collection\"><b>Click Here to see the entire Acorn Heart Tip Collection</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/6-1-2-inch-offset-rough-iron-cabinet-heart-tip-strap-hinge-acorn-ri9bq\"><b>6-1/2 Inch Offset Rough Iron Cabinet Heart Tip Strap Hinge</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/6-1-2-inch-smooth-iron-cabinet-heart-tip-strap-hinge-acorn-aijbq\"><b>6-1/2\" Smooth Iron Cabinet Strap Hinges</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Acorn Heart Tip Cabinet Strap Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>For exterior and interior use.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with black finish mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime No-Rust Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 6-1/2\" Heart Tip Offset Cabinet Strap Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Rough Black Iron</b></li>\r\n<li>Material: Iron</li>\r\n<li>Length: 6-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>For doors whose face sits flush with the door frame.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold as a pair (2-hinges).</i>\r\n</p>",
